      "message_id": "4da4a21c-7b28-456d-9c96-eb6df987cafe"
    },
    {
      "user": "Yeah sure, so",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:15.867+00:00",
      "message_id": "1767984"
    },
    {
      "user": "\u092f\u093e\u0930 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:17.356+00:00",
      "message_id": "1768449"
    },
    {
      "user": "\u092c\u091c\u0947 \u0915\u093e slot \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u094b \u0915\u0932 \u0915\u093e.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:19.358+00:00",
      "message_id": "1769046"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Bilkul, aaryak garg. Kitne logon ke liye table chahiye kal?",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:20.696+00:00",
      "message_id": "8f50b3c5-ec3a-4a46-b20e-b0914dc4d2c7"
    },
    {
      "user": "\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0932\u094b\u0917\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f table \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f \u0924\u0940\u0928 \u092c\u091c\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u0932.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:27.198+00:00",
      "message_id": "1771199"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Theek hai, kal teen baje, chaar logon ke liye table ho jayegi. Koi special occasion hai ya bas casual milna hai?",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:31.677+00:00",
      "message_id": "907dad05-09e8-4f44-a296-9e62a373ae82"
    },
    {
      "user": "\u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092c\u093e\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948. \u0906\u092a \u092c\u0938 book \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0940\u091c\u093f\u090f.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:40.879+00:00",
      "message_id": "1773754"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Bilkul, note kar liya. Kya kisi ko dietary preference ya allergy ka dhyaan rakhna hai?",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:42.366+00:00",
      "message_id": "50e7da1f-c625-4451-9154-b6d26f2a894a"
    },
    {
      "user": "\u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u092c\u0938 book \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0940\u091c\u093f\u090f \u0938\u0940\u0927\u093e.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:48.847+00:00",
      "message_id": "1775323"
    },
    {
      "user": "Please book \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0940\u091c\u093f\u090f.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:50.256+00:00",
      "message_id": "1775758"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Theek hai, ek last cheez - aapko seating ka koi preference hai? Outdoor seating nahi hai, lekin doosre floor par smoking area hai.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:38:51.722+00:00",
      "message_id": "67c89400-8c6d-4965-9127-f93be80c07cd"
    },
    {
      "user": "\u0939\u093e\u0902 sure. So seating \u0915\u093e by window.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:39:02.975+00:00",
      "message_id": "1778316"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Note kar",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:39:04.475+00:00",
      "message_id": "52335e37-6634-44eb-9e14-17ffb1a9adc3"
    },
    {
      "user": "Near window",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:39:04.897+00:00",
      "message_id": "1779156"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Bilkul, near window seating note kar liya. Toh aapka booking hai - chaar log, kal, teen baje, near window, aaryak garg ke naam par. Sab theek hai?",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:39:05.846+00:00",
      "message_id": "da00920f-3480-4617-a814-0710349dc2a5"
    },
    {
      "user": "All good.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T23:39:15.301+00:00",
      "message_id": "1781357"
    },
    {
      "bot": "Aapka table reserve ho gaya, aaryak garg. Manager aapko jaldi call karega. See you tomorrow!",
